* ============================================================================
* 16_collab_mechanism.do — Mechanism: collab → R&D intensity / capex_it (P5)
* Paper: {{PAPER_ID}}
* v3.4.0: Chesbrough 2003 open innovation → 资源配置 → outcome 因果链
* 白话: 检验"走开放式协同创新的银行"是否在研发强度 / IT 投入 / 专利产出上表现不同,
* 为主回归的效应提供机制层面的解释。
* ============================================================================

version 19
clear all
set more off
set maxvar 32767

if "$data_dir" == ""    global data_dir "../data"
if "$tables_dir" == ""  global tables_dir "../output/tables"

use "$data_dir/_prepared_panel.dta", clear

set seed {{RANDOM_SEED}}

* Mechanism A: collab → R&D intensity (自主研发强度信号; Cohen & Levinthal 1990 absorptive capacity)
capture confirm variable r_and_d_intensity
if !_rc {
    reghdfe r_and_d_intensity collab_open_full collab_closed_full $controls, ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
    eststo Mech_RD
}

* Mechanism B: collab → capex_it (IT 资本投入)
capture confirm variable capex_it
if !_rc {
    reghdfe capex_it collab_open_full collab_closed_full $controls, ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
    eststo Mech_CAPEX
}

* Mechanism C: collab → patent_fintech_count (创新产出)
capture confirm variable patent_fintech_count
if !_rc {
    reghdfe patent_fintech_count collab_open_full collab_closed_full $controls, ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
    eststo Mech_PAT
}

* fix(omni-g-templates-07, 2026-06-11): esttab 名单动态化 — Mech_RD/Mech_CAPEX/
* Mech_PAT 全部在守卫块内 (r_and_d_intensity/capex_it/patent_fintech_count 均为
* CSMAR enrichment 列), 任一缺失旧版硬点名 → r(111) 丢整表; 全缺时如实告警跳过。
qui estimates dir
local stored `r(names)'
local cand_models Mech_RD Mech_CAPEX Mech_PAT
local cand_titles `""R&D Intensity" "IT CapEx" "Patent Count""'
local models ""
local mtitles `""'
local nmod : word count `cand_models'
forvalues i = 1/`nmod' {
    local m : word `i' of `cand_models'
    if `: list m in stored' {
        local models `models' `m'
        local t : word `i' of `cand_titles'
        local mtitles `"`mtitles' "`t'""'
    }
}
if "`models'" == "" {
    display as error "  [WARN] Table 3 无任何已存储机制估计 (CSMAR enrichment 列全缺), 表跳过"
}
else {
    esttab `models' using "$tables_dir/table3_mechanism.tex", replace ///
        star(* 0.10 ** 0.05 *** 0.01) se booktabs label compress b(3) ///
        title("Mechanism --- bank_fintech_collab (P5)") ///
        mtitles(`mtitles')

    display "[OK] Table 3 (mechanism) → $tables_dir/table3_mechanism.tex"
}
